        "full_width": true,
        "remove_vertical_spacing": false,
        "remove_horizontal_spacing": false,
        "liquid": "{% comment %}\nMIRELLIS — COMMUNITY PAGE RESEARCH NOTES\nPlacement:\n→ Add AFTER:\n\"Shared Rhythms Shape the Nervous System\"\n\nSmaller + softer than other Research Notes sections\nFocused on social rhythm, co-regulation, environment, and wellbeing\n{% endcomment %}\n\n<section class=\"mirellis-research-minimal\">\n\n  <details class=\"mirellis-research-details\">\n\n    <summary>\n      Research Notes +\n    </summary>\n\n    <div class=\"mirellis-research-content\">\n\n      <div class=\"mirellis-research-item\">\n        <h4>Social connection & emotional regulation</h4>\n        <p>\n          Research suggests that social connection and shared emotional environments may influence stress regulation, resilience, and overall psychological wellbeing.\n        </p>\n        <a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3150158/\" target=\"_blank\">\n          NIH / PMC →\n        </a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"mirellis-research-item\">\n        <h4>Shared behavioral rhythms & wellbeing</h4>\n        <p>\n          Studies exploring daily behavioral rhythms suggest that consistent routines and synchronized social timing may support emotional stability and physiological regulation.\n        </p>\n        <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC5449130/\" target=\"_blank\">\n          NIH / PMC →\n        </a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"mirellis-research-item\">\n        <h4>Environment, atmosphere & stress response</h4>\n        <p>\n          Environmental psychology research suggests that atmosphere, sensory surroundings, and environmental pacing can influence stress perception and emotional state.\n        </p>\n        <a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4873188/\" target=\"_blank\">\n          NIH / PMC →\n        </a>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </details>\n\n</section>\n\n<style>\n\n.mirellis-research-minimal {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 24px 20px;\n}\n\n.mirellis-research-details {\n  max-width: 580px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n\n.mirellis-research-details summary {\n  list-style: none;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font-size: 11px;\n  letter-spacing: 0.22em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: rgba(0,0,0,0.58);\n  font-family: serif;\n  transition: opacity 0.2s ease;\n  text-align: center;\n  width: 100%;\n}\n\n.mirellis-research-details summary:hover {\n  opacity: 0.7;\n}\n\n.mirellis-research-details summary::-webkit-details-marker {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n.mirellis-research-content {\n  padding-top: 20px;\n}\n\n.mirellis-research-item {\n  margin-bottom: 22px;\n}\n\n.mirellis-research-item h4 {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  color: #1f1f1f;\n  margin-bottom: 7px;\n  font-family: serif;\n}\n\n.mirellis-research-item p {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  line-height: 1.75;\n  color: rgba(0,0,0,0.68);\n  margin-bottom: 7px;\n}\n\n.mirellis-research-item a {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  color: #1f1f1f;\n  text-decoration: underline;\n  text-underline-offset: 3px;\n}\n\n@media screen and (max-width: 768px) {\n\n  .mirellis-research-minimal {\n    padding: 22px 18px;\n  }\n\n  .mirellis-research-details {\n    max-width: 100%;\n  }\n\n  .mirellis-research-details summary {\n    font-size: 10px;\n    letter-spacing: 0.18em;\n  }\n\n  .mirellis-research-item h4 {\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n\n  .mirellis-research-item p {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n\n}\n\n</style>",
