          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/fragrance-journey-process-illustration.png",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "title": "Ritual Comes First. Community Follows.",
            "heading_bottom_content": "",
            "content": "<p>We do not believe in building engagement for the sake of activity.</p><p>At Mirellis, community emerges naturally when people return to the same rituals, experience similar transitions, and begin noticing the subtle ways rhythm affects clarity, grounding, restoration, and emotional pacing.</p><p>Morning rituals create orientation.</p><p>Evening rituals create slowing.</p><p>Over time, shared practice creates shared understanding.</p><p>This keeps participation intentional rather than performative.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
