div>\n\n      <div class=\"am-compare-section-item\">\n        <span class=\"am-compare-section-icon am-compare-section-icon-positive\">✔</span>\n        <span>Guided, not algorithmic</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"am-compare-section-item\">\n        <span class=\"am-compare-section-icon am-compare-section-icon-positive\">✔</span>\n        <span>Focused on depth, not scale</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- What it is not -->\n    <div class=\"am-compare-section-card\">\n      <h2 class=\"am-compare-section-title am-compare-section-title-negative\">\n        What it is not\n      </h2>\n\n      <div class=\"am-compare-section-item\">\n        <span class=\"am-compare-section-icon am-compare-section-icon-negative\">✖</span>\n        <span>A social feed</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"am-compare-section-item\">\n        <span class=\"am-compare-section-icon am-compare-section-icon-negative\">✖</span>\n        <span>A discussion board</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"am-compare-section-item\">\n        <span class=\"am-compare-section-icon am-compare-section-icon-negative\">✖</span>\n        <span>Built for noise or constant activity</span>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>",
