          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>This space is for people who:</p><ul><li>value consistency over intensity<br/></li><li>prefer rhythm over optimization<br/></li><li>seek clarity without overstimulation<br/></li><li>move toward slower, more intentional routines<br/></li><li>believe wellbeing is shaped through repeated daily practice<br/></li></ul><p>You do not need to be an expert.</p><p>You do not need to participate publicly.</p><p>You only need to return.</p>"
